WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:01.150
In one minute,

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.750
you'll have picked a direction,

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.300
and left a note.

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:06.517
Step one: open the board.

00:00:06.654 --> 00:00:08.757
Claude runs showtime studio open,

00:00:08.757 --> 00:00:10.824
and gives you a private, local link.

00:00:11.364 --> 00:00:13.584
The link opens the board in your browser.

00:00:13.854 --> 00:00:15.464
Each concept is a card,

00:00:15.464 --> 00:00:17.094
with style frames, a hook,

00:00:17.094 --> 00:00:18.869
a palette, and a music sketch.

00:00:19.679 --> 00:00:21.299
Step two: compare.

00:00:21.328 --> 00:00:24.715
Click the thumbnails to step
through a concept's style frames.

00:00:25.265 --> 00:00:27.555
Press play to hear its music sketch:

00:00:27.635 --> 00:00:29.678
ten seconds of the bed it would use.

00:00:30.218 --> 00:00:31.118
Further down,

00:00:31.118 --> 00:00:33.728
Compare puts two concepts side by side.

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:36.703
Drag across the frame to wipe
from one to the other.

00:00:37.493 --> 00:00:38.921
Step three: react.

00:00:38.921 --> 00:00:41.025
Press L to like the concept in focus,

00:00:41.025 --> 00:00:42.230
or click the heart.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.022
Press C to leave a note,

00:00:44.022 --> 00:00:45.230
in your own words.

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:46.408
Rough is fine.

00:00:46.928 --> 00:00:48.678
Control Enter sends it.

00:00:48.778 --> 00:00:51.553
Every reaction is saved
to the job as you go.

00:00:52.223 --> 00:00:53.543
Step four: pick.

00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:55.610
Click Pick on the direction you want.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.271
Press the full stop key
to review everything you've sent.

00:00:59.802 --> 00:01:01.422
Then tell Claude you're done.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:02.950
It runs studio feedback,

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.500
reads your pick and your note,

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.400
and builds from your choice.

00:01:06.692 --> 00:01:08.902
Open, compare, react, pick.

00:01:08.987 --> 00:01:09.950
The full guide is

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:11.100
the studio reference,

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.200
in the showtime skill.
